<title>USA: Kemper names Froehlich as investment strategist.</title>
<headline>Kemper names Froehlich as investment strategist.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kemper Funds said it named Robert Froehlich to the newly created post of chief investment strategist.</p>
<p>Previously, Froehlich held the same title at Van Kampen American Capital, a unit of Morgan Stanley Group Inc.</p>
<p>Kemper is a unit of Zurich Kemper Investments Inc, part of Zurich Insurance Group.</p>
